      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i have this really bad cough like im hacking up stuff all day and its driving me crazy. i saw some cough syrup at the drugstore that has dextromethorphan in it. is that okay to take? im already on sertraline for my depression so i just wanna make sure there isnt any weird reaction or anything.",
