      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait really? no interaction at all? i was reading online about serotonin syndrome and how mixing certain things can be bad if you're already on an SSRI. are you sure i wont be fine if i take a full dose? i'm pretty desperate to stop coughing so i might take a little extra if the standard dose doesnt work right away.",
